{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Academy, a place that seemed perfect for her... After all, she is a future, great witch! As it turned out, fate willed otherwise and young Nora, after\u00a0her Grandma's passing, must now go back to Lillyton to clain her inheritance - old Granny's house.\u00a0But this task may be more difficult than it looks at first glance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras/24b41bb054546f90e31960ae66868748.avif?t=1753814276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras_big/24b41bb054546f90e31960ae66868748.avif?t=1753814276 width=800 height=258 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nora: In Search of Hidden Ingredients</strong>\u00a0is a unique combination of two types of games - <strong>kinetic visual novel,</strong> in which you will learn the story of a young adept of magic, her relationship with her beloved grandmother as well as a heartwarming tale of where true magic comes from.\u00a0The second is a classic <strong>hidden object game</strong>\u00a0In which you have to show cleverness and resourcefulness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras/82923126c851def1e51e7aa7c37ec73e.avif?t=1753814276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras_big/82923126c851def1e51e7aa7c37ec73e.avif?t=1753814276 width=800 height=494 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful!\u00a0A certain Spirit, has decided to put your skills to the test, and until you pass the obstacles put up by him...\u00a0Reality is now shifting\u00a0and your surroundings seem to be subject to some random, variable laws of nature...\u00a0<br><br><strong>Will you help Nora fulfill her destiny?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras/3293927f6a36479fd9879fcf6882eaac.avif?t=1753814276\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859820/extras_big/3293927f6a36479fd9879fcf6882eaac.avif?t=1753814276 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game key features\u00a0\u2935\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0f Clever combination of kinetic visual novel &amp; hidden-object games<br>\u25b6\ufe0f 29 HO levels in 9 unique locations full of story bits to discover and objects to find <br>\u25b6\ufe0f An inquisitive Spirit\u00a0decided to make Nora's task, a bit more tricky so...<br>\u25b6\ufe0f...The levels as well as some of the items you  have to find are randomly generated! <br>\u25b6\ufe0f Beautiful, hand-drawn visuals\u00a0that will enchant you with their style<br>\u25b6\ufe0f Unlimited freeplay mode for HO fans</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start this magical adventure with Nora today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entrance Area Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859820/aed7182885a79b154764e904156542d188fa2ca6.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859820/c6c95336d1898d351e3876eb5fb639fc4825e501.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859820/a05f485a2fc29f93300e388d831c96df4744d0d4.jpg"},{"name":"Living Room Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859820/918e4a9ea33f15c3e6570af4f56022c58ce89ff5.jpg"},{"name":"Herbal